docs/adr/ADR-SPECGRAPH-*.md -text
docs/ADR-001_SPECGRAPH_NORTH_STAR.md -text
docs/SPEC-SPECGRAPH-001.md -text
docs/adr/ADR-059_SPECGRAPH_CURATION_SCOPE_AND_SNAPSHOT_ISOLATION.md -text
docs/evidence/** -text
planning/completion-program.json -text
planning/traceability-mappings.json -text

# ADR-SPECGRAPH-009 keeps its original final blank line.
docs/adr/ADR-SPECGRAPH-009.md whitespace=-blank-at-eof

